-- Ten Canva / Photoshop / Illustrator basics in one poster: gradient, opacity and blend, drop shadow, glow,
-- photo adjustments, a photo in a shape, several lines of aligned text, text on an arc, a placed SVG path.
create a canvas called effects, 1080 by 1350.

draw a circle called sun, 330 big, at 800 330.
draw a circle called portrait, 190 big, at 250 330.
draw a rectangle called panel, 920 by 420, corners 36, at 540 1040.
draw a path called leaf, "M0 0 C40 -70 130 -70 170 0 C130 70 40 70 0 0 Z", at 720 640, scale 1.6, turned -24.
write "LIMITED EDITION" called arc in Jost, at 250 112, size 30, curved 222, tracking 8.
write "Golden\nHour" called title in Lilita One, at 100 660, size 170, leading 0.92, aligned left.
write "A poster made of code: gradients, glows, shadows, photo filters and frames, all written as plain sentences." called body in Jost, at 130 960, size 42, 780 wide, leading 1.3, aligned left.
write "studiomorgana.xyz" called foot in Martian Mono, at 950 1200, size 26, aligned right.

on the front.
enamel the card in a gradient from #1b1145 to #c2334d to #ffb347, angled 80.
glow the sun in #ffd98a, 90 wide, strength 2.
enamel the sun in a radial gradient from #fff6c9 to #ffb347.
enamel the leaf in #0e6b4f, 85% opacity, multiply.
shadow the portrait, 18 down, blur 30, 55% opacity.
print @marilyn.jpg in the portrait, grayscale, contrast 1.25, focused at 0.5 0.25.
enamel the arc in #ffe9c4.
shadow the title, 10 down, 6 right, blur 14, in #2a0a3a, 60% opacity.
enamel the title in a gradient from #fff6c9 to #ffb347, angled 90.
shadow the panel, 24 down, blur 48, 50% opacity.
enamel the panel in #ffffff, 16% opacity.
enamel the body in #fff4e0.
enamel the foot in #ffd98a.
